Epoch_2b_childWithdraw
├── given the active strategy is remote on Child
├── and a depositor has claimed Yieldcoin shares from a prior epoch
├── and the epoch has net withdrawals
├── when CRE closes the epoch through Parent WorkflowRouter
├── then ParentVault should mark the epoch executing
├── and ParentVault should open the next epoch
├── when CRE executes the withdraw through Child WorkflowRouter
├── then ChildVault should bridge withdrawn USDC back to Parent
├── and ParentVault should become claimable after local CCIP delivery
└── and the withdrawer should claim the full settled USDC while shares are burned

Epoch_2b_childWithdraw_subminimumDeferral
├── given the active strategy is remote on Child
├── and the aggregate remote net withdrawal is below the minimum asset amount
├── when CRE attempts to close the epoch through Parent WorkflowRouter
├── then ParentVault should revert and leave the epoch open without spending Child LINK
├── when another withdrawal raises the aggregate amount to the minimum
├── then ParentVault should close the same epoch and request the full remote withdrawal
└── and the withdrawer should receive the settled asset after Child execution
